esentations passing both child filters. This adds full primitive coefficient provenance and exact first/second moments of that actual count under independent uniform shifts. It also constructs a marker-minimum threshold with an exact finite half-survival count, including ties, for a fixed valid original relation. All endpoints assemble unchanged at actual prime-field Weierstrass subgroups. [pcc:unverified]\n\nThe three shared modules contain 28 named laws. The explicit shifted architecture still tests 2b^3 translated points; the report identifies the missing charged coordinate-aware batch query. Density/fiber and construction costs are hand analysis. The complete end-to-end algorithm criterion remains unmet. [pcc:unverified]\n\nValidation: focused builds and actual-field probes pass; canonical all-source gate audits 205 theorems, zero failures and zero trusted-native exceptions. Explicit axiom prints for all 28 laws use only standard allowed axioms. No fresh lean4checker pass. The three-page PDF and diagram were inspected. Original failed floors/API/builds remain, as does the explicit diff002-to-diff003 correction; source/prose whitespace check passes, while full archival checks retain original compiler-warning spaces. [pcc:unverified]\n\nClaim PCC-20261116-a6bb62 remains unverified and pins ten subjects. The owner ledger extends main's row without rewriting history. Crypto PR4311/4338/4352 frozen histories and pending resolvers stay untouched. Prior owner PR17's zero-step billing failure is archived separately; hosted results for this PR are pending. No native numerical, paid or qualification run. [pcc:unverified]\n\nReport: [auxiliary-shift-20261115.md](docs/auxiliary-shift-20261115.md); [PDF](docs/auxiliary-shift-20261115/report.pdf); [publication boundary](docs/auxiliary-shift-20261115/PUBLICATION.md). Prospective six-field plans, inheritance/statement maps, exact commands and raw receipts accompany the source.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason